OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost 5,000 evacuated in City of
OL,4,ALondon gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 4,700 people were evacuated in
OL,7,Fthe City of London after a gas leak.
OL,9,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) said it
OL,10,Fwas called to Old Broad Street at 10:55
OL,11,FBST, where crews found a ruptured
OL,12,Fsix-inch gas main at a six-storey
OL,13,Foffice building.
OL,15,FA 200m cordon was put in place between
OL,16,FThreadneedle Street and London Wall,
OL,17,Fwith nearby buildings evacuated as a
OL,18,Fprecaution. The brigade has now removed
OL,19,Fits cordon, and people are being
OL,20,Fallowed back into affected properties.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
