OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost 5,000 evacuated in City of
OL,4,ALondon gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Cadent spokesperson said the pipe was
OL,7,F"severely damaged by a private
OL,8,Fconstruction team" and stressed the
OL,9,Fwork that caused the damage "had
OL,10,Fnothing to do with Cadent or its
OL,11,Fpipework".
